} Test and profile each. You might find that option #1 is fastest if there isn't a lot of work for each thread, or you may find that with optimizations on, there is no difference (or even a slowdown) when enabling OMP. Edit I've adopted the MCVE supplied in the comments as follows: #include <iostream>
